  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">描述</span></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_3d16c543-ce85-4c52-8fcc-bdd7a19992a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"441\" height=\"120\"></span></h2><h5><strong>米食饗宴</strong>是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>農夫樂事</strong></a>的擴充模組，為米飯帶來全新風味與獨特性，同時為遊戲增添新作物。</h5><h5>&nbsp;</h5><h5>享用美味佳餚，透過<strong>甜椒</strong>或<strong>羅勒</strong>等新作物擴展您的農場。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_ad7dc5b9-2fa2-4d6c-a58b-8c0c69ac5bcf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"413\"></p><h5>深入探索<strong>墨西哥捲餅</strong>或<strong>暖心料理</strong>的世界，其中一些菜餚可能喚起您<strong>童年</strong>的回憶。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_d7abfc78-81a3-4373-b891-02a5adfc7841.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"717\" height=\"406\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1419951/description_34edd519-a656-403d-9c18-37dd7f4a45d3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"714\" height=\"393\"></p><hr><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h4><strong>🔨 模組載入器<br></strong></h4><h5>米食饗宴是<strong>Forge</strong>模組，目前沒有<strong>Fabric</strong>版本，亦無相關移植計畫。</h5>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
